# Root-context .dockerignore. Every service Dockerfile builds from the repo root
# and `COPY services/<name>/ ...`, so patterns MUST be recursive (`**/`) to
# exclude nested service paths — a bare `tests`/`.env` only matches the root.
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.env
**/.env.example
**/tests
**/docs
**/.git
